<title>PORTUGAL: Bank of Portugal injects 12.5 bln esc, 6.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Portugal injects 12.5 bln esc, 6.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 12.5 billion escudos of seven-day funds into the money market at a fixed rate of 6.90 percent in a securities repurchase tender, effective tomorrow.</p>
<p>The rate compared with 7.0090 percent previously.</p>
<p>-- LISBON BUREAU 3511-3538254</p>
